d begins learning how to rely on others while supporting them in return.\n\nNonetheless, the life of a professional is not easy. Between tournaments, championships, and title matches, the pressure mounts as Rei advances through the ranks and encounters incredibly skilled opponents. As he manages his relationships with those who have grown close to him, the shogi player continues to search for the reason he plays the game that defines his career."},"tags":[{"name":"Coming of Age","rank":97,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Rehabilitation","rank":96,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Found Family","rank":92,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Family Life","rank":89,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Shogi","rank":85,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Seinen","rank":84,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Bullying","rank":81,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":80,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Philosophy","rank":80,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Urban","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Iyashikei","rank":70,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tragedy","rank":67,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Board Game","rank":63,"spoiler":false},{"name":"School","rank":61,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Estranged Family","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Adult Cast","rank":56,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Food","rank":46,"spoiler":false},{"name":"School Club","rank":40,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Disability","rank":34,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Age Gap","rank":30,"spoiler":true}],"titles":{"display":"March comes in like a lion Season 2","english":"March comes in like a lion Season 2","native":"３月のライオン 第2シリーズ","romaji":"3-gatsu no Lion 2nd Season","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"3月的狮子 第二季"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"Sangatsu no Lion (2017)"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"March Comes In Like a Lion (2017)"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"三月的狮子 第二季"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"三月的狮子 2期"}]},"trailer":{"id":"OfSaJb5OOPA","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg